{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"26":{"eng-name":"The Book of Marriage","ara-name":"كتاب النكاح"}},"section_detail":{"26":{"hadithnumber_first":3196,"hadithnumber_last":3388,"arabicnumber_first":3196,"arabicnumber_last":3388}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3377,"arabicnumber":3377,"text":"Rapporté par 'Aishah : Le Prophète m’a épousée au mois de Shawwal, et il a consommé le mariage avec moi au mois de Shawwal. Parmi ses épouses, laquelle a eu plus de faveur auprès de lui que moi ?","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":26,"hadith":182},"chapter":{"id":77,"ara-name":"باب الْبِنَاءِ فِي شَوَّالٍ .","eng-name":"Consummating The Marriage In Shawwal","isFirstHadith":true}}]}